&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bend Fire &amp;amp; Rescue Stations: &lt;/strong&gt;

     &lt;ul&gt;
          &lt;li&gt;West Fire Station &ndash; 1212 SW Simpson Ave., Bend&lt;/li&gt;
          &lt;li&gt;East Fire Station &ndash; 62420 Hamby Rd., Bend&lt;/li&gt;
          &lt;li&gt;North Fire Station &ndash; 63377 Jamison St., Bend&lt;/li&gt;
          &lt;li&gt;South Fire Station &ndash; 61080 Country Club Dr., Bend&lt;/li&gt;
          &lt;li&gt;Tumalo Fire Station &ndash; 64725 Cook Ave., Tumalo&lt;/li&gt;
          &lt;li&gt;Pilot Butte Fire Station &ndash; 425 NE 15th&amp;nbsp;St., Bend&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;/ul&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thank you for helping give back to our neighbors this season. Learn more about the NeighborImpact Food Bank at &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.neighborimpact.org/get-help/foodbank/"&gt;neighborimpact.org/get-help/foodbank/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Looking for more ways to give?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bend Fire &amp;amp; Rescue&rsquo;s Santa Express &lt;/strong&gt;is coming to Bend neighborhoods Dec. 5, 6 and 8 collecting donations of new toys, gently used coats and non-perishable food. Learn more about this fun community event at &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.bendoregon.gov/santa-express"&gt;bendoregon.gov/santa-express&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NeighborImpact&rsquo;s&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https://neighborimpact.jotform.com/251627182890058&amp;amp;data=05%7c02%7cdhauck%40bendoregon.gov%7caafa672650524b6fec1b08de2891df52%7c1c15334815ef4708aebf1e25e57dc400%7c0%7c0%7c638992804157498399%7cUnknown%7cTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7c0%7c%7c%7c&amp;amp;sdata=3nL/VR4HZO%2Bel8ZWfxhyw8u11wvkwYMQq0nB2QM/Wog%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Online Food Drive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;allows you to donate fresh produce and healthy staples for local food banks.&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Donate money&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to NeighborImpact or a food pantry near you.&lt;/li&gt;
