&lt;p&gt;ODHS asks the public for help in the effort to find Tyler Shoop and to contact 911 or local law enforcement if they believe they see Tyler Shoop.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Tyler Shoop is suspected to be in Clackamas or Portland Metro area.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

