&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RICHLAND, Wash.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&mdash; Washington State University Tri-Cities&rsquo; continuing education program, Cougar Tracks, has announced February 2026 dates for its Manager Coaching Series, an applied, four-part leadership development program designed to strengthen management capacity across the Tri-Cities region.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
